r for Prey.<br /> * Feeling scared that other people will find out your son/daughter/whatever has anorexia because you have failed as a parent / friend / whatever is an Ugallu with Hunger for Punishment.<br /> * Feeling scared that nothing can be done is Anakim with Hunger for Prey<br /> * Feeling overwhelmed by the situation you are forced in to is Makara with a Hunger for Prey. The distinction here is &quot;I want to escape but can't.&quot;<br /> * The fear that someone may be Anorexic is ... the shadow ones whose name I cant remember. Hunger for Prey.</div> </div> </div> </div>I endorse this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-12T09:33:36-08:00","id":784803,"title":"","content":"SoulGambit, those shadow ones are called Eshmaki. Your post is spot on, by the way. Have a Like.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-12T09:49:44-08:00","id":784814,"title":"","content":"<b>Gorgons</b> - Fear of revulsion. In this case, the delusion that you are fat and disgusting, regardless of how malnourished you may actually be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-12-2015, 12:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}